<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ's National Bank lifts 2, 3 yr home loan rates.</title>
<headline>NZ's National Bank lifts 2, 3 yr home loan rates.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of New Zealand said on Friday it had lifted its two-year fixed rate for home loans to 9.40 percent per annum and its three-year fixed rate to 9.50 percent per annum.</p>
<p>Both were previously 9.25 percent.</p>
<p>The one-year rate remains unchanged at 8.95 percent, while the floating rate remains unchanged at 9.95 percent.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
